  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "If \\((x,y)\\) is a solution to the system \\[ \\begin{aligned} xy&=6,\\\\ x^2y+xy^2+x+y&=63, \\end{aligned} \\] find \\(x^2+y^2.\\)",
